OL,3,GNEWSABirthing unit could reopen by end
OL,4,Aof next month
OL,5,
OL,6,FHealth officials have said they are
OL,7,F"cautiously optimistic" a closed
OL,8,Fmaternity unit could reopen by the end
OL,9,Fof next month.
OL,11,FThe Royal Devon University Healthcare
OL,12,FNHS Foundation Trust suspended births
OL,13,Fat the hospital in Barnstaple on 11
OL,14,FAugust due to staffing issues, meaning
OL,15,Fwomen in north Devon have been facing
OL,16,Flong journeys to give birth.
OL,18,FA spokesperson for the trust said it
OL,19,Fwas continuing to work "urgently" to
OL,20,Freopen maternity services.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
