OL,3,GNEWSABirthing unit could reopen by end
OL,4,Aof next month
OL,5,
OL,6,F"We are making solid progress and
OL,7,Frecruiting the medical staffing needed
OL,8,Fto achieve this safely. We are
OL,9,Fcautiously optimistic that we may be in
OL,10,Fa position to do this by the end of
OL,11,FSeptember, subject to final recruitment
OL,12,Fand safety assurances," they said.
